{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"知识管理基础认知","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-pkm","title":"什么是个人知识管理","url":"/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/foundations/what-is-pkm","wordCount":1225,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"cognitive-science-of-knowledge","title":"知识的认知科学基础","url":"/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/foundations/cognitive-science-of-knowledge","wordCount":1521,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-lifecycle","title":"信息生命周期管理","url":"/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/foundations/information-lifecycle","wordCount":1513,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 知识管理基础认知\n\n在选择工具和方法之前，需要先理解「知识」本身的运作规律。本章从三个维度铺垫基础：PKM 的定义与核心循环、人类认知系统对知识的处理机制、以及信息从原始输入到可复用资产的完整生命周期。\n\n这三篇文档形成递进关系：先明确「什么是 PKM」，再理解「大脑为什么需要外部系统辅助」，最后掌握「信息流经系统的每个阶段应该做什么」。完成本章后，你将带着清晰的认知框架进入第二章的方法论选型。\n"}